  "dct_title_s": "World Maritime Indicators, 1:50 million (2012)",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This line shapefile depicts boundaries on land and offshore boundary water indicators, including a partial selection of key 200-mile nautical limits, plus some disputed, treaty, and median lines, These data are represented at 1:50,000,000 scale. This layer is part of the Natural Earth Collection (v.2.0.0).",
    "Natural Earth is a public domain map dataset available at 1:10, 1:50 and 1:110 million scales. Featuring tightly integrated vector and raster data, with Natural Earth you can make a variety of visually pleasing, well-crafted maps with cartography or GIS software."
